    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist our upcoming game: Mirth Island</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721960/extras/9eee7e0c1af18c87b327daf287be382a.avif?t=1723741216\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2>Mirth Melody is a small rhythm game set in the Mirth Island universe. In this game, you play as Dodo the duck, exploring a beautiful little forest. Strum your favorite guitar and watch as the forest creatures happily vibe along to your music.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2>- Explore the tiny forest as Dodo the duck<br>- Interact with various items and animals<br>- Play your guitar and watch as forest creatures gather and dance to your music<br><br>If you enjoy playing it, please consider checking out Mirth Island and adding it to your wishlist: Mirth Island Steam Page",
